<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 to $1.00 higher. Demand was moderate. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 53.00-53.50, few 52.50, some 54.00</p>
<p>Sows - firm/up $1.00. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  42.00-46.00</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs.  46.00-49.00</p>
<p>	     500-600 lbs.  49.00-52.00</p>
<p>	     few over 600 lbs.  51.00-53.00</p>
</text>
